      "name": "SetScreenResolution",
      "signature": "void SetScreenResolution(int nMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Initialize screen dimensions based on resolution mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Default to 640x480 resolution (0x280 x 0x1e0 pixels)\n  2. If nMode is non-zero, override to 800x600 (0x320 x 0x258 pixels)\n  3. Store dimensions in global variables g_dwScreenWidth and g_dwScreenHeight\n\nParameters:\n  nMode (ECX): Resolution mode selector\n    0 = 640x480 mode\n    non-zero = 800x600 mode\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nNotes:\n  This function initializes DirectDraw display parameters. Called during window setup.\n  The values 0x280 and 0x320 are width values; heights are set to 0 (unused/calculated elsewhere).",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CON",
      "index": "CON:88025ef3779e539dcb48131a8d0a6779",
