      "name": "ShutdownDirectDraw",
      "signature": "void ShutdownDirectDraw(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Shuts down the DirectDraw graphics subsystem and releases all related resources.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check if DirectDraw is initialized (0x6f8f1b94 != 0)\n  2. Call DirectDraw cleanup routine FUN_6f8e1c20()\n  3. Release DirectDraw surface object with virtual destructor at offset +0x8\n  4. Clear DirectDraw surface pointer and active flag\n  5. Log message \"Shutting down DirectDraw...\"\n  6. Release DirectDraw palette object with virtual destructor at offset +0x8\n  7. Release main DirectDraw object with virtual destructor at offset +0x8\n  8. Log message \"...DirectDraw shut down.\"\n  9. Delete critical section and release pool memory\n  10. Call final cleanup routine FUN_6f8e34d0()\n  11. Mark DirectDraw as uninitialized\n\nParameters:\n  (none - no parameters)\n\nReturns:\n  void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Null pointer checks before calling virtual destructors\n  Critical section cleanup ensures thread-safe resource deallocation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:546c17e22a38a8e15c8829671ea3e893",
