      "name": "Divide128By64",
      "signature": "ulonglong Divide128By64(uint dwLowDividend, uint dwHighDividend, uint dwDivisor, uint dwDivisorHigh)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Performs 128-bit unsigned integer division (128\u00f764\u219264).\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. If divisor high (param_4) is 0, perform simple 64-bit division\n  2. Otherwise, shift divisor and dividend right until divisor high becomes 0\n  3. Perform division and adjust quotient if remainder is too large\n  4. Return 64-bit quotient in EAX:EDX\n\nParameters:\n  EAX/param_1: Low 32 bits of 128-bit dividend\n  EDX/param_2: High 32 bits of 128-bit dividend\n  EBX/param_3: Low 32 bits of 64-bit divisor\n  ECX/param_4: High 32 bits of 64-bit divisor\n\nReturns:\n  EDX:EAX: 64-bit quotient (EAX=low, EDX=high)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Division by zero not handled (caller must validate)\n  Quotient overflow returns truncated result",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
