      "name": "InitializeDirectDrawVideo",
      "signature": "int InitializeDirectDrawVideo(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initializes DirectDraw video mode and creates primary surface\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Check if already initialized; abort if so\\n2. Set display dimensions to 0x280x0x1e0 (640x480)\\n3. Determine color depth from bit masks (0x10/0x18/0x20 bytes)\\n4. Call SetDisplayMode method with width/height/depth\\n5. On success: handle error; on failure: create primary surface\\n6. Initialize surface descriptor array (0x1a dwords)\\n7. Call CreatePrimarySurface with surface descriptor\\n8. On success: set error flags and return success\\n9. On failure: call error handler and return 0\\nReturns: 1 on init success, 0 on display error\\nSpecial Cases: Aborts entire process if already initializing",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:448116e1e26350f3a8ddcc5f981e20ca",
