      "name": "InitializeVideoResourcePalette",
      "signature": "int InitializeVideoResourcePalette(void * pResourceManager)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Initialize video resource palette and rendering buffers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set global resource manager pointer (DAT_6f8cfdc4 = pResourceManager)\n2. Call virtual method at offset 0x50 (SetCooperativeLevel) with parameter 0x11\n3. Check result: if error, log message and return 0\n4. Zero-fill 256 dwords (1024 bytes) at DAT_6f8cfdc8 (palette buffer)\n5. Call virtual method at offset 0x14 with parameters (4, &DAT_6f8cfdc8, &DAT_6f8d0230, 0)\n   (CreatePalette with DDPCAPS_PRIMARYSURFACE flag)\n6. Check result: if error, log message and return 0\n7. Call FUN_6f8c85a0 to finalize initialization\n8. Return initialization result\n\nParameters:\n- pResourceManager (ECX): void* - Video resource manager instance pointer\n\nReturns:\n- EAX: int - 0 on error, otherwise result from FUN_6f8c85a0\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Magic number 0x11: SetCooperativeLevel flag (DDSCL_NORMAL | DDSCL_MULTITHREADED)\n- Magic number 0x4: CreatePalette flag (DDPCAPS_PRIMARYSURFACE)\n- Buffer DAT_6f8cfdc8: 256-entry palette buffer (1024 bytes total)\n- DAT_6f8d0230: Palette object pointer (output from CreatePalette)\n- Error strings document display initialization failures",
